1. First, ensure you have correctly integrated the SDK into your project following the provided documentation.
2. Initialize the SDK with your application key or access token as soon as the page loads or when the script is executed.
3. Once initialized, use a function or method provided by the SDK to retrieve the user session data. This may vary depending on the SDK. For instance, with Firebase:

